# ByteLens .gitignore
# Hard rule (AGENTS.md §2): never commit binaries, packed samples, or generated
# adversarial PEs. Commit hashes and split lists only.

# ── Datasets ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Raw samples are immutable and gitignored; hashes and split lists stay tracked.
datasets/raw/*
!datasets/raw/README.md
# Parsed features and renders are regenerable artifacts
datasets/processed/*
!datasets/processed/README.md
!datasets/processed/adversarial/README.md

# ── Models ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Serialized weights are gitignored; models/MANIFEST.md is tracked.
models/*
!models/MANIFEST.md

# ── Run artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Records are the source of paper numbers; the JSONL chain is append-only and
# hashed. Snapshots are machine-local (hardware/git context differs across
# machines), so they stay untracked — freeze locks and split locks are the
# tracked commitments (ADR-009).
logger/runs/
logger/*.jsonl
logger/*.parquet
paper/artifacts/
paper/build_manifest.json
notebooks/.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── Personal working reports (local only, never tracked) ───────────────────
reports/

# ── Environments & secrets (Design Dungeons §06) ───────────────────────────
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.venv/
venv/

# ── Python ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
build/
dist/

# ── Editors / OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
